    "description": "Comprehensive Postman Collection for Daily Task Backend API (NestJS + Prisma + JWT + Gemini AI).\n\n### Features:\n- Automated Token Handling: Register, Login, and Refresh automatically capture `accessToken` and `refreshToken` into collection variables.\n- Resource ID Chaining: Creating a Category, Task, or AI Conversation automatically saves `categoryId`, `taskId`, and `conversationId`.\n- Standard Response Envelopes: All endpoints are modeled after the application's unified response interceptor `{ success, message, data }`.",
